Subject: Fil-C libc++ and libc++abi runtime adaptations
Upstream-Base: LLVM main (1bd1774757f8fb19c0a06f84cbb53076b75eafbb)
Fil-C-Head: cede3de02b42b58a14acc9ce39c9894ab952a915 (branch deluge)

Adapts libc++abi exception personality to <pizlonated_eh_landing_pad.h>,
prefixes exported symbols in .exp lists with pizlonated_, adjusts libc++
CMake/atomic/locale/chrono/tzdb hooks, and guards llvm-libc cfloat16.h
under __FILC__ for aarch64 demangler builds.

Fil-C-Origin-Commits (3):
  37785dac5b13dc137467b21a6ca71e34a6c74d9d 2026-09-26 cosmo: aarch64 libc++ + gen_shims arch gate + argv2 exclusion
  1636dbb63e6bdf76451c30b38743345114bbc5ba 2026-09-19 cosmo: libc++/libc++abi for the cosmo flavor (static) + C++ tests enabled
  d292f5dbb951d549fc9b053950d5a330d532b361 2025-08-22 Rebase Fil-C to clang/llvm 20.1.8

Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-20.1.8 -> llvmorg-21.1.8):
  - libcxx/CMakeLists.txt: context updated for LIBCXX_USE_COMPILER_RT option moved above ABI library options.

Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-21.1.8 -> llvmorg-22.1.8):
  - libc/include/llvm-libc-macros/cfloat16-macros.h: moved __FILC__ guard here after LLVM 22 extracted macros from cfloat16.h.
  - libcxx/CMakeLists.txt: context updated for quoted CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME.
  - libcxx/include/__atomic/contention_t.h: added _LIBCPP_HAS_COSMO_LIBC guard to both _LIBCPP_ABI_ATOMIC_WAIT_NATIVE_BY_SIZE branches.
  - libcxx/src/atomic.cpp: adapted __PIZLONATOR_WAS_HERE__ futex hooks to LLVM 22's templated __platform_wait_on_address / __platform_wake_by_address.
  - libcxxabi/src/cxa_exception.h & cxa_personality.cpp: preserved LLVM 22 ptrauth qualifiers and lsd_ptr_t typedef on non-Fil-C paths.


Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-22.1.8 -> llvmorg-23.1.6):
  - libcxx/CMakeLists.txt & __config_site.in: context updated for LIBCXX_HAS_C11_THREAD_API and removed _LIBCPP_HAS_TERMINAL.
  - libcxx/include/__atomic/contention_t.h: context updated for __Fuchsia__ checks.
  - libcxx/include/__config: context updated for _LIBCPP_LIBC_LLVM_LIBC and relocated rune-table block.
  - libcxx/src/atomic.cpp: context updated for Fuchsia platform section.
  - libcxx/src/experimental/tzdb.cpp: context updated for _LIBCPP_WEAK -> [[gnu::weak]].
  - libcxxabi/src/cxa_personality.cpp: context updated for comment typo fix.


Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-23.1.6 -> LLVM main 1bd1774757f8):
  - libcxx/include/__config -> __locale_dir/support/linux.h: _LIBCPP_PROVIDES_DEFAULT_RUNE_TABLE moved to per-platform support headers in LLVM main; added _LIBCPP_HAS_COSMO_LIBC to support/linux.h.
  - libcxx/include/__locale_dir/locale_base_api.h: context updated for removed _LIBCPP_HIDE_FROM_ABI qualifiers.
  - libcxxabi/src/cxa_thread_atexit.cpp: context updated for pthread #pragma comment block.

